WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.245
Tyson and the Squeak-Thump Secret

00:00:02.895 --> 00:00:07.516
“THAT TOY STAYS OUTSIDE.” “TOO LOUD FOR INSIDE.” “OUTSIDE ONLY.

00:00:07.766 --> 00:00:11.129
PROMISE?” “I PROMISE!” “JUST ONE SQUEAK...”

00:00:11.979 --> 00:00:15.000
“JUST ONE SQUEAK.” “HEE-HEE!” “UH-OH.”

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:16.660
QUICK!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.405
BEFORE ANYONE SEES!

00:00:18.655 --> 00:00:22.611
“NOBODY WILL EVER KNOW.” “WHAT'S THAT NOISE?” “SHHH!”

00:00:23.461 --> 00:00:25.105
“DID IT JUST...

00:00:25.355 --> 00:00:28.970
MOVE?” “DID YOU HEAR THAT?” “HEAR WHAT?!” “PHEW!”

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.268
“WHAT'S THAT SOUND?” “THE DOG DID IT!” “WEIRD.”

00:00:34.118 --> 00:00:37.646
“IT'S SO LOUD!” “I DON'T HEAR ANYTHING.” “BUT...

00:00:37.896 --> 00:00:38.840
BUT...”

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:41.249
“MAKE IT STOP!”

00:00:42.099 --> 00:00:43.626
“IT WON'T STOP!”

00:00:44.476 --> 00:00:46.002
“IT WON'T STOP!”

00:00:46.852 --> 00:00:51.108
“I CONFESS!” “I BROKE THE DUCK!” “GASP!” “TYSON...

00:00:51.358 --> 00:00:53.206
THANK YOU FOR TELLING US.”

00:00:54.056 --> 00:00:58.062
“IT'S JUST A TOY, SILLY!” “ALL FIXED!” “PHEW!” “HUH?”

00:00:58.912 --> 00:01:02.178
“MY TUMMY WAS THE NOISE!” “IT WAS ME ALL ALONG!”
